Historical Note:
---------------
MicroEMACS was originally placed in the public domain by Dave Conroy.
Linus Torvalds' modifications maintained this spirit of open source
development. This modern C23 implementation by Will Clingan (2025)
continues that tradition while using a BSD-style license to clarify
terms for modern distribution and package management requirements.

Contributors:
-------------
- Dave Conroy (original μEmacs author, 1985-1987)
- Linus Torvalds (Linux-focused enhancements, 1991-1993)
- Petri Kutvonen (maintenance and improvements)
- Will Clingan (modern C23 implementation, 2025)

For a complete list of contributors and detailed history, see:
- HISTORY.md
- docs/DEVELOPMENT.md
- Git commit history
